(rectangle (start 170.18 15.24) (end 335.28 95.25) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "81daccfb-6975-4ac2-9ba0-c1e3b932fc5e"))
(text "DESIGN NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 171.45 16.51 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4a00831c-6cd2-4266-93fa-94e5e14d2e62"))
(text "Supply: 3S LiPo, 9.0 V (empty) to 12.6 V (full). DRV8302 PVDD1 min = 8 V.\nMOSFETs: BSC009NE2LS5, VDS 25 V, RDS(on) 0.9 mOhm, Qg 43 nC @ 10 V.\nTVS SMBJ15A: standoff 15 V > 12.6 V, clamp 24.4 V < 25 V.\nCurrent sense: 1 mOhm low-side shunts, GAIN = high (40 V/V), REF = 3V3\n   -> Vso = 1.65 V - 40 x I x 1 mOhm, full scale +/-41 A. Phase C is not\n   measured: Ic = -(Ia + Ib). Route SPx / SNx as Kelvin pairs to the shunt.\nVDS overcurrent: OC_ADJ = 3.3 x 4.7k / 104.7k = 0.148 V (minimum usable is\n   0.125 V) -> trip ~165 A cold / ~115 A hot: short-circuit protection only.\n   Real current limit is done in firmware from the shunts. M_OC = high (latch).\nDead time: RDTC 10k -> ~80 ns. M_PWM = low: 6 PWM inputs (GP0-GP5).\nBuck (TPS54160 core): Vout = 0.8 x (1 + 53.6k/10.2k) = 5.00 V,\n   RT 200k -> 585 kHz, L 22 uH (ripple 0.23 A), Css 10 nF -> 4 ms,\n   type II comp: 43.2k + 4.7 nF, 12 pF (fc ~ 14.5 kHz, Cout 2 x 22 uF).\nVBUS sense: 47k/10k -> 2.21 V @ 12.6 V, full scale 18.8 V.\nLayout: AGND joins GND at the DRV8302 PowerPAD only. Place 10 uF + 100 nF\n   at each half-bridge, gate loops short, NTC TH1 near the low-side FETs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 171.45 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c1a31167-b456-44e1-b85e-df8c382ac02d"))
(rectangle (start 15.24 15.24) (end 165.1 124.46) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "7baebc2f-5655-407b-a34f-ccfc71ea2a66"))
(text "POWER INPUT 3S (9 - 12.6 V)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16.51 16.51 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f20799d3-4b1b-4621-a65a-eb37a246a114"))
